{
    "song_id": 10111939,
    "title": "Backslide",
    "language": "en",
    "lyricists": "[50268]",
    "lyrics": [
        {
            "section_id": "section_0",
            "type": "intro",
            "performer": "",
            "lines": [
                {
                    "n": "0",
                    "text": "(I don't wanna)",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "section_id": "section_1",
            "type": "verse",
            "performer": "",
            "lines": [
                {
                    "n": "0",
                    "text": "Rat race, place to place, adding weight",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "1",
                    "text": "Tendencies on repeat, innit?",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "2",
                    "text": "Benefit from a shoe with no lace",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "3",
                    "text": "Take the seat with the crease in it",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "4",
                    "text": "I don't mind if it's lonely",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "5",
                    "text": "I don't mind if it's fair",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "6",
                    "text": "I don't care, you control me",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "7",
                    "text": "Leading me anywhere",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "section_id": "section_2",
            "type": "chorus",
            "performer": "",
            "lines": [
                {
                    "n": "0",
                    "text": "I don't wanna backslide to where I've started from",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "1",
                    "text": "There's no chance I will shake this again",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "2",
                    "text": "'Cause I feel the pull, water's over my head",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "3",
                    "text": "Strength enough for onе more time",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "4",
                    "text": "Reach my hand abovе the tide",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "5",
                    "text": "I'll take anything you have",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "6",
                    "text": "If you could throw me a line",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "7",
                    "text": "I should've loved you better",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "8",
                    "text": "Do you think that now's the time",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "9",
                    "text": "You should let go?",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "10",
                    "text": "It's over my head",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "section_id": "section_3",
            "type": "verse",
            "performer": "",
            "lines": [
                {
                    "n": "0",
                    "text": "Bad place, on a hundred-dollar bass",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "1",
                    "text": "Kinda wishin' that I never did \"Saturday\"",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "2",
                    "text": "\"Is that a stain? You should change",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "3",
                    "text": "Are you doin' good?",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "4",
                    "text": "Did you solve all of your problems?\"",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "5",
                    "text": "Thanks for asking, in a way, but",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "6",
                    "text": "Accidentally uncovered a new one yesterday",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "7",
                    "text": "What happened to what I brushed under the rug?",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "8",
                    "text": "I used to be the champion of a world you can't see",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "9",
                    "text": "Now I'm drowning in logistics",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "section_id": "section_4",
            "type": "chorus",
            "performer": "",
            "lines": [
                {
                    "n": "0",
                    "text": "I don't wanna backslide to where I've started from",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
